<Who nb="1"/>
Ke:mah eski. 
<Who nb="2"/>
Ke:mah.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="507.516" endTime="514.739">
<Sync time="507.516"/>
Pos nejó:n, komamo teh *más** tine:chnohno:tsas *de** yo:ni nejó:n, *o** taka..., *o** ta:ká:n teisá: tikelna:miki ok.
